          { title: '角度決定比例', description: '兩個直角三角形只要有相同銳角，其相對應邊長比例就相同。' }
        ], takeaway: '口訣：正弦對斜、餘弦鄰斜、正切對鄰。' },
      { type: 'formula', label: '核心公式', eyebrow: 'KEEP THIS FORMULA', title: '三角函數的基本關係',
        lead: '熟悉基本恆等式，就能在只知道 sin 或 cos 的情況下，求出另一個量。',
        formula: { name: '畢氏恆等式', expression: 'sin²θ + cos²θ = 1', note: '對所有實數角 θ 都成立。' },
        hints: [
          '當 cos θ ≠ 0，tan θ = sin θ / cos θ。',
          '特殊角：sin 30° = 1/2、cos 60° = 1/2。',
          '特殊角：sin 45° = cos 45° = √2/2。'
        ], takeaway: 'sin²θ 表示 (sin θ)²，不是 sin(θ²)。' },
      { type: 'worked', label: '解題示範', eyebrow: 'LET’S SOLVE IT', title: '用 sin 求出未知邊長',
        lead: '用文字辨認哪一條是對邊，再套入比例，比硬記題型更有效。',
        problem: '一個直角三角形的斜邊長 10，某銳角為 30°，求這個角的對邊長。',
        steps: [
          { title: '選擇正確比例', detail: '因為已知斜邊、要求對邊，所以使用 sin θ = 對邊 / 斜邊。' },
          { title: '代入已知數值', detail: 'sin 30° = 對邊 / 10；又 sin 30° = 1/2。' },
          { title: '移項求答案', detail: '對邊 = 10 × (1/2) = 5。' }
        ], answer: '對邊長為 5。' },
      { type: 'quiz', label: '小測驗', eyebrow: 'A LITTLE CHECK-IN', title: '特殊角記住了嗎？',
        lead: '這個值在三角函數題裡面經常出現。',
        question: 'cos 60° 的值是多少？', options: ['0', '1/2', '√2/2', '√3/2'], correctIndex: 1,
        explanation: '特殊角三角比中，cos 60° = 1/2；也可以從 30°-60°-90° 直角三角形得到。' }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'sequences', number: '04', level: '高二', category: '代數', title: '數列與級數',
    summary: '等差、等比、求第 n 項與總和，找到數字的規律。',
    keywords: ['等差', '等比', '公差', '公比', '級數', '求和', 'sequence'],
    color: '#eee8d5', symbol: 'aₙ', coverLine: 'PATTERNS · SERIES',
    slides: [
      { type: 'overview', label: '觀念導讀', eyebrow: 'START WITH THE IDEA', title: '數列就是有順序的數字',
        lead: '3、7、11、15……看起來像一串數字，實際上藏著「每次加 4」的規律。',
        points: [
          { title: '等差數列', description: '相鄰兩項的差都固定，例如 3、7、11、15，公差 d = 4。' },
          { title: '等比數列', description: '相鄰兩項的比都固定，例如 2、6、18、54，公比 r = 3。' },
          { title: '第 n 項', description: '找出規律，就不用從第一項一路數到第 n 項。' },
          { title: '級數', description: '把數列的前幾項加起來，例如 Sₙ 表示前 n 項和。' }
        ], takeaway: '判斷關鍵：固定「相減」是等差；固定「相除」是等比（前項不為 0）。' },
      { type: 'formula', label: '核心公式', eyebrow: 'KEEP THIS FORMULA', title: '先熟悉等差數列公式',
        lead: '給定首項和公差，就能快速求出任何一項；要求和時記得首尾配對。',
        formula: { name: '等差數列第 n 項', expression: 'aₙ = a₁ + (n − 1)d', note: 'a₁ 是首項，d 是公差，n 是項數。' },
        hints: [
          '等差級數：Sₙ = n(a₁ + aₙ) / 2。',
          '等比數列：aₙ = a₁r⁽ⁿ⁻¹⁾。',
          '等比級數：當 r ≠ 1，Sₙ = a₁(1 − rⁿ) / (1 − r)；當 r = 1，Sₙ = na₁。'
        ], takeaway: '易錯點：aₙ 的指數或公差倍數都是 n − 1，不是 n。' },
      { type: 'worked', label: '解題示範', eyebrow: 'LET’S SOLVE IT', title: '一次算出第 8 項與前 8 項和',
        lead: '同一題把「第 n 項」和「前 n 項和」串起來練習。',
        problem: '等差數列首項 a₁ = 3、公差 d = 4。求 a₈ 與 S₈。',
        steps: [
          { title: '確定已知條件', detail: 'a₁ = 3，d = 4，項數 n = 8。' },
          { title: '計算第 8 項', detail: 'a₈ = 3 + (8 − 1) × 4 = 3 + 28 = 31。' },
          { title: '計算前 8 項和', detail: 'S₈ = 8 × (3 + 31) / 2 = 4 × 34 = 136。' }
        ], answer: 'a₈ = 31；S₈ = 136。' },
      { type: 'quiz', label: '小測驗', eyebrow: 'A LITTLE CHECK-IN', title: '下一項你找得到嗎？',
        lead: '記得用 n − 1，不要看錯項數。',
        question: '等差數列 a₁ = 5、公差 d = 3，第 6 項 a₆ = ?',
        options: ['18', '20', '23', '26'], correctIndex: 1,
        explanation: 'a₆ = 5 + (6 − 1) × 3 = 5 + 15 = 20。' }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'probability', number: '05', level: '高二', category: '統計', title: '排列組合與機率',
    summary: '先分清楚要不要排序，再選排列、組合或機率公式。',
    keywords: ['排列', '組合', '古典機率', '階乘', '抽球', 'probability'],
    color: '#e6e4f1', symbol: 'P(A)', coverLine: 'COUNTING · CHANCE',
    slides: [
      { type: 'overview', label: '觀念導讀', eyebrow: 'START WITH THE IDEA', title: '到底要用排列還是組合？',
        lead: '最重要的不是先套公式，而是先問：「同樣的人選出來，交換順序會不會變成不同結果？」',
        points: [
          { title: '排列：順序重要', description: '例如選出冠軍和亞軍，A 冠 B 亞與 B 冠 A 亞是不同結果。' },
          { title: '組合：順序不重要', description: '例如從五個人選兩人組隊，A+B 和 B+A 是同一隊。' },
          { title: '階乘符號 !', description: 'n! = n × (n−1) × … × 1，且 0! = 1。' },
          { title: '古典機率', description: '若所有基本結果等可能，P(A) = 有利結果數 / 全部結果數。' }
        ], takeaway: '最重要的判斷：順序有差 → 排列；順序沒差 → 組合。' },
      { type: 'formula', label: '核心公式', eyebrow: 'KEEP THIS FORMULA', title: '排列與組合一張搞懂',
        lead: '先確定共有 n 個物件、要選 r 個，且 0 ≤ r ≤ n。',
        formula: { name: '組合公式', expression: 'C(n, r) = n! / [r!(n − r)!]', note: '不考慮選取順序；例如五人選兩人是 C(5, 2)。' },
        hints: [
          '排列公式：P(n, r) = n! / (n − r)!。',
          '排列與組合的關係：P(n, r) = C(n, r) × r!。',
          '等可能的基本結果下：P(A) = n(A) / n(S)。'
        ], takeaway: '如果樣本空間不是等可能，不能直接用「有利數 ÷ 全部數」計算。' },
      { type: 'worked', label: '解題示範', eyebrow: 'LET’S SOLVE IT', title: '五個人選兩個怎麼算？',
        lead: '看到「選組員」就先想：交換兩個人的順序，會產生新的一組嗎？',
        problem: '從 5 位同學中挑 2 位當值日生，總共有幾種選法？',
        steps: [
          { title: '判斷順序是否重要', detail: '兩人都是值日生，沒有正副或名次，所以順序不重要，用組合。' },
          { title: '帶入組合公式', detail: 'C(5, 2) = 5! / (2! × 3!)。' },
          { title: '約分計算', detail: 'C(5, 2) = (5 × 4) / (2 × 1) = 10。' }
        ], answer: '共有 10 種選法。' },
      { type: 'quiz', label: '小測驗', eyebrow: 'A LITTLE CHECK-IN', title: '把機率變成一個分數',
        lead: '假設每顆球被抽中的機會相同。',
        question: '袋子裡有 4 顆紅球、3 顆藍球，隨機抽 1 顆，抽到紅球的機率是？',
        options: ['3/7', '4/7', '1/4', '4/3'], correctIndex: 1,
        explanation: '共 7 顆球、紅球 4 顆；在每顆球等可能的前提下，P(紅) = 4/7。' }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'derivatives', number: '06', level: '高三', category: '函數', title: '微分與導數入門',
    summary: '從切線斜率、導數公式到極值，建立微分的基本觀念。',
    keywords: ['微分', '導數', '切線', '斜率', '極值', 'derivative'],
    color: '#f0e1d9', symbol: 'f′', coverLine: 'SLOPE · CHANGE',
    slides: [
      { type: 'overview', label: '觀念導讀', eyebrow: 'START WITH THE IDEA', title: '導數在描述「變化有多快」',
        lead: '想像在某個點把函數放大到非常近，曲線看起來像一直線；那條切線的斜率，就是那個點的導數。',
        points: [
          { title: '切線斜率', description: 'f′(a) 表示函數 y = f(x) 在 x = a 的切線斜率（若導數存在）。' },
          { title: '斜率正負', description: '若某區間上 f′(x) > 0，函數在那個區間遞增；f′(x) < 0 時遞減。' },
          { title: '斜率為零', description: 'f′(a) = 0 代表水平切線，但不一定就是極大或極小。' },
          { title: '用在極值問題', description: '找可能的極值點時，先找導數為零或不存在的位置，再進一步判斷。' }
        ], takeaway: '導數不是只會拿來算：它是在幫我們讀懂函數的變化。' },
      { type: 'formula', label: '核心公式', eyebrow: 'KEEP THIS FORMULA', title: '微分最常用的冪次法則',
        lead: '多項式函數的微分可以一項一項算，先掌握最基礎的冪次法則。',
        formula: { name: '冪次微分法則', expression: 'd(xⁿ)/dx = nxⁿ⁻¹', note: '對實數 n，在 xⁿ 有定義且可微的範圍內使用。' },
        hints: [
          '常數微分是 0：d(c)/dx = 0。',
          '常數倍可提出：d[cf(x)]/dx = c f′(x)。',
          '逐項相加：d[f(x) + g(x)]/dx = f′(x) + g′(x)。'
        ], takeaway: '注意：把原指數乘到前面後，原指數必須減 1。' },
      { type: 'worked', label: '解題示範', eyebrow: 'LET’S SOLVE IT', title: '求導數，再找切線斜率',
        lead: '把每一項分開微分，就能快速找到指定位置的斜率。',
        problem: '已知 f(x) = x³ − 3x² + 2，求 f′(x) 與 f′(2)。',
        steps: [
          { title: '逐項微分', detail: 'x³ 微分為 3x²；−3x² 微分為 −6x；常數 2 微分為 0。' },
          { title: '整理導數', detail: 'f′(x) = 3x² − 6x。' },
          { title: '代入指定位置', detail: 'f′(2) = 3 × 2² − 6 × 2 = 12 − 12 = 0。' }
        ], answer: 'f′(x) = 3x² − 6x；f′(2) = 0。' },
      { type: 'quiz', label: '小測驗', eyebrow: 'A LITTLE CHECK-IN', title: '微分熟練度 Check!',
        lead: '先把原指數乘下來，再將指數減一。',
        question: 'f(x) = 5x³，則 f′(x) = ?',
        options: ['5x²', '15x²', '15x³', 'x⁴'], correctIndex: 1,
        explanation: '利用冪次法則，d(5x³)/dx = 5 × 3x² = 15x²。' }
    ]
  }
];

</script>
<script>
/*
 * 數學慢慢懂 — 靜態網站互動邏輯
 * 章節內容全部放在 data/chapters.js，新增內容不需修改本檔。
 */
(() => {
  'use strict';

  const chapters = window.MATH_CHAPTERS;
  if (!Array.isArray(chapters)) {
    document.getElementById('resultsCount').textContent = '章節載入失敗，請確認 data/chapters.js 檔案是否存在。';
    return;
  }

  const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const homeView = $('homeView');
  const readerView = $('readerView');
  const chapterGrid = $('chapterGrid');
  const searchInput = $('searchInput');
  const filterGroup = $('filterGroup');
  const letters = ['A', 'B', 'C', 'D'];
  let activeFilter = '全部';
  let activeChapter = null;
  let activeSlide = 0;
  const quizSelections = new Map();

  // 所有章節文字都經過跳脫，避免未來新增的內容被解讀為 HTML。
  function escapeHTML(input) {
    return String(input ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, (char) => ({
      '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#39;'
    })[char]);
  }

  function completedChapters() {
    try {
      return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('math-notes-completed') || '[]');
    } catch {
      return [];
    }
  }

  function markCompleted(chapterId) {
    try {
      const completed = new Set(completedChapters());
      completed.add(chapterId);
      localStorage.setItem('math-notes-completed', JSON.stringify([...completed]));
    } catch {
      // 隱私模式可能禁止儲存；不影響做題及導覽。
    }
  }

  function renderCards() {
    const query = searchInput.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('zh-Hant');
    const matches = chapters.filter((chapter) => {
      const matchCategory = activeFilter === '全部' || chapter.category === activeFilter;
      const searchable = [chapter.title, chapter.summary, chapter.category, chapter.level, ...(chapter.keywords || [])].join(' ').toLocaleLowerCase('zh-Hant');
      return matchCategory && (!query || searchable.includes(query));
    });
    const completed = new Set(completedChapters());
    chapterGrid.innerHTML = matches.map((chapter) => `
      <a class="chapter-card" href="#chapter/${encodeURIComponent(chapter.id)}/1" aria-label="閱讀${escapeHTML(chapter.title)}">
        <div class="card-cover" style="background:${escapeHTML(chapter.color)}">
          <div class="cover-bubble"></div>
          <div class="cover-top"><span class="cover-chapter">CHAPTER ${escapeHTML(chapter.number)}</span><span class="cover-category">${escapeHTML(chapter.category)} · ${escapeHTML(chapter.level)}</span></div>
          <div class="cover-symbol" aria-hidden="true">${escapeHTML(chapter.symbol)}</div>
          <span class="cover-doodle">${escapeHTML(chapter.coverLine)}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-info"><span class="card-label">${escapeHTML(chapter.level)} · MATH NOTES</span><h3>${escapeHTML(chapter.title)}</h3><p>${escapeHTML(chapter.summary)}</p>
          <div class="card-footer"><div class="card-meta">${chapter.slides.length} 頁講義 <span class="dot">·</span> 含練習題 ${completed.has(chapter.id) ? '<span class="card-complete">✓ 已完成</span>' : ''}</div><span class="card-go">開始閱讀 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
    `).join('');
    $('resultsCount').textContent = `找到 ${matches.length} 個章節 · 共 ${chapters.length} 個主題`;
    $('emptyState').hidden = matches.length !== 0;
  }

  function slideMarkup(slide, chapter) {
    const top = `<span class="slide-tag">${escapeHTML(slide.eyebrow)}</span><h2>${escapeHTML(slide.title)}</h2><p class="slide-lead">${escapeHTML(slide.lead)}</p><div class="slide-divider"></div>`;
    let content = '';
    switch (slide.type) {
      case 'overview':
        content = `<div class="points-grid">${slide.points.map((point, index) => `
          <div class="point-box"><span class="point-number">0${index + 1} / POINT</span><h3>${escapeHTML(point.title)}</h3><p>${escapeHTML(point.description)}</p></div>
        `).join('')}</div>`;
        break;
      case 'formula':
        content = `<div class="formula-box"><div class="formula-label">✳ ${escapeHTML(slide.formula.name)}</div><div class="formula-expression">${escapeHTML(slide.formula.expression)}</div><p class="formula-note">${escapeHTML(slide.formula.note)}</p></div><div class="hint-list">${slide.hints.map((hint) => `<div class="hint-item"><span class="check-symbol">✳</span><span>${escapeHTML(hint)}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>`;
        break;
      case 'worked':
        content = `<div class="worked-problem"><span class="small-label">EXAMPLE / 題目</span><p>${escapeHTML(slide.problem)}</p></div><div class="worked-steps">${slide.steps.map((step, index) => `
          <div class="worked-step"><span class="step-badge">${index + 1}</span><div><h3>${escapeHTML(step.title)}</h3><p>${escapeHTML(step.detail)}</p></div></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="answer-box"><small>✓ FINAL ANSWER</small>${escapeHTML(slide.answer)}</div>`;
        break;
      case 'quiz': {
        const selected = quizSelections.get(chapter.id);
        const responded = Number.isInteger(selected);
        const correct = selected === slide.correctIndex;
        content = `<div class="worked-problem"><span class="small-label">YOUR TURN / 試試看</span><p>${escapeHTML(slide.question)}</p></div>
          <div class="quiz-options" role="group" aria-label="選擇答案">${slide.options.map((option, index) => `
            <button type="button" class="quiz-option ${responded && index === slide.correctIndex ? 'is-correct' : ''} ${responded && index === selected && !correct ? 'is-wrong' : ''}" data-answer="${index}" ${responded ? 'disabled' : ''}>
              <span class="option-letter">${letters[index] || (index + 1)}</span><span>${escapeHTML(option)}</span>
            </button>`).join('')}</div>
          ${responded ? `<div class="quiz-feedback ${correct ? '' : 'is-wrong'}" role="status"><strong>${correct ? '答對了！這個觀念已經學會 ✦' : '還差一點點，看看解題提示 ♡'}</strong><p>${escapeHTML(slide.explanation)}</p></div>${!correct ? '<button type="button" class="secondary-btn" id="retryQuiz" style="margin-top:13px">再試一次</button>' : ''}` : ''}`;
        break;
      }
      default:
        content = '<p>尚未支援的講義類型，請確認章節資料。</p>';
    }
    return top + content + (slide.takeaway ? `<div class="takeaway"><strong>✦ 小筆記 NOTE TO SELF</strong>${escapeHTML(slide.takeaway)}</div>` : '');
  }

  function updateReader() {
    if (!activeChapter) return;
    const chapter = activeChapter;
    const total = chapter.slides.length;
    const slide = chapter.slides[activeSlide];
    $('readerBreadcrumbTitle').textContent = chapter.title;
    $('readerKicker').textContent = `CHAPTER ${chapter.number} · ${chapter.level} · ${chapter.category}`;
    $('readerTitle').textContent = chapter.title;
    $('readerSummary').textContent = chapter.summary;
    $('readerCount').textContent = `${activeSlide + 1} / ${total}`;
    $('progressBar').style.width = `${((activeSlide + 1) / total) * 100}%`;
    $('slideList').innerHTML = chapter.slides.map((item, index) => `
      <button type="button" class="${index === activeSlide ? 'is-active' : ''}" data-slide="${index}" aria-current="${index === activeSlide ? 'step' : 'false'}"><span class="slide-index">0${index + 1}</span>${escapeHTML(item.label)}</button>
    `).join('');
    $('slideContent').innerHTML = slideMarkup(slide, chapter);
    $('prevSlide').disabled = activeSlide === 0;
    $('nextSlide').textContent = activeSlide === total - 1 ? '回到講義庫 ↗' : '下一頁 →';
    $('pageIndicator').textContent = `${String(activeSlide + 1).padStart(2, '0')} / ${String(total).padStart(2, '0')}`;
    document.title = `${chapter.title}｜數學慢慢懂`;
  }

  function navigateToSlide(index) {
    if (!activeChapter) return;
    const next = Math.min(Math.max(index, 0), activeChapter.slides.length - 1);
    location.hash = `#chapter/${encodeURIComponent(activeChapter.id)}/${next + 1}`;
  }

  function showHome(target = 'home') {
    activeChapter = null;
    homeView.hidden = false;
    readerView.hidden = true;
    document.title = '數學慢慢懂｜高中數學重點整理';
    renderCards();
    document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link').forEach((link) => link.classList.toggle('is-current', link.dataset.nav === target));
    if (target !== 'home') {
      requestAnimationFrame(() => $(target)?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' }));
    } else {
      window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'instant' });
    }
  }

  function handleRoute() {
    const hash = decodeURIComponent(location.hash.slice(1));
    const match = hash.match(/^chapter\/([a-z0-9-]+)\/(\d+)$/);
    if (match) {
      const chapter = chapters.find((item) => item.id === match[1]);
      if (chapter) {
        const requestedIndex = Number(match[2]) - 1;
        const chapterChanged = activeChapter?.id !== chapter.id;
        activeChapter = chapter;
        activeSlide = Math.min(Math.max(requestedIndex, 0), chapter.slides.length - 1);
        homeView.hidden = true;
        readerView.hidden = false;
        updateReader();
        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'instant' });
        if (chapterChanged) {
          document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link').forEach((link) => link.classList.remove('is-current'));
        }
        return;
      }
    }
    showHome(['home', 'chapters', 'about'].includes(hash) ? hash : 'home');
  }

  filterGroup.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
    const button = event.target.closest('[data-filter]');
    if (!button) return;
    activeFilter = button.dataset.filter;
    filterGroup.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach((item) => {
      const active = item === button;
      item.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
      item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
    });
    renderCards();
  });
  searchInput.addEventListener('input', renderCards);
  $('resetSearch').addEventListener('click', () => {
    searchInput.value = '';
    filterGroup.querySelector('[data-filter="全部"]').click();
    searchInput.focus();
  });
  $('slideList').addEventListener('click', (event) => {
    const button = event.target.closest('[data-slide]');
    if (button) navigateToSlide(Number(button.dataset.slide));
  });
  $('slideContent').addEventListener('click', (event) => {
    const answer = event.target.closest('[data-answer]');
    if (answer && activeChapter && activeChapter.slides[activeSlide]?.type === 'quiz') {
      const index = Number(answer.dataset.answer);
      quizSelections.set(activeChapter.id, index);
      const quiz = activeChapter.slides[activeSlide];
      if (index === quiz.correctIndex) markCompleted(activeChapter.id);
      updateReader();
    }
    if (event.target.closest('#retryQuiz') && activeChapter) {
      quizSelections.delete(activeChapter.id);
      updateReader();
    }
  });
  $('prevSlide').addEventListener('click', () => navigateToSlide(activeSlide - 1));
  $('nextSlide').addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (activeChapter && activeSlide === activeChapter.slides.length - 1) {
      location.hash = '#chapters';
    } else navigateToSlide(activeSlide + 1);
  });
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
    if (!activeChapter || event.altKey || event.ctrlKey || event.metaKey) return;
    if (['INPUT', 'TEXTAREA', 'SELECT'].includes(document.activeElement?.tagName)) return;
    if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft' && activeSlide > 0) navigateToSlide(activeSlide - 1);
    if (event.key === 'ArrowRight' && activeSlide < activeChapter.slides.length - 1) navigateToSlide(activeSlide + 1);
  });

  $('chapterTotal').textContent = chapters.length;
  $('noteTotal').textContent = chapters.reduce((count, chapter) => count + chapter.slides.length, 0);
  window.addEventListener('hashchange', handleRoute);
  handleRoute();
})();

</script>
</body>
</html>
